                                            CW Opportunity 2 LP does not charge a management fee but does charge an incentive fee of
                                            <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--IncentiveFeePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesCPreferredStockMember_z7rIMI94Bvih" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:IncentiveFeePercentage" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_SeriesCPreferredStockMember" id="Fact001071" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">20</ix:nonFraction></span>%, subject to an annual <span id="xdx_904_ecustom--HurdleRatePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesCPreferredStockMember_z2hsRwbeQua5" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:HurdleRatePercentage" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_SeriesCPreferredStockMember" id="Fact001072" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">15</ix:nonFraction></span>% IRR hurdle rate. During the quarter ended June 30, 2026, Neostellar
                                            Capital received distributions as part of its investment in CW Opportunity 2 LP. The distributions
                                            represented approximately <span id="xdx_908_ecustom--RetainsInvestmentPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20260401__20260630__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--CWOpportunity2LPMember_zEFcf6uPbhAc" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA" title="Retains investment percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:RetainsInvestmentPercentage" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30_custom_CWOpportunity2LPMember" id="Fact001074" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">12.2</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the initial investment in CW Opportunity 2 LP. As of June
                                            30, 2026, Neostellar Capital retains approximately <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--RetainsInvestmentPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20260101__20260630__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--CWOpportunity2LPMember_zLwmzUSdBbKd" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA" title="Retains investment percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:RetainsInvestmentPercentage" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_custom_CWOpportunity2LPMember" id="Fact001076" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">55.9</ix:nonFraction></span>% of its investment in CW Opportunity
                                            2 LP.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr></table>

