<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in"><span id="xdx_F09_zLAw8DgUS4H8" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(4)</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1F_z46LECgrLsW9" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001547" xml:lang="en-US">Denotes
                                            an investment considered Level 1 or Level 2 and valued using observable inputs. Refer to
                                            &#8220;Note 4&#8212;Investments at Fair Value&#8221;.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in"><span id="xdx_F06_zbg9TxkPZ8Ee" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(5)</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1A_z1GUlVVMDrp4" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001548" xml:lang="en-US">ARK
                                            Type One Deep Ventures Fund LLC is an investment fund for which the Class A Interest is solely
                                            invested in the Series A-2 Preferred Shares of OpenAI Global, LLC. Neostellar Capital Corp.
                                            is invested in the Series A-2 Preferred Shares of OpenAI Global, LLC through its investment
                                            in the Class A Interest of ARK Type One Deep Ventures Fund LLC. ARK Type One Deep Ventures
                                            Fund LLC charges a <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--ManagementFeePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231_z8Dd41LueoB8" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA" title="Management fee percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:ManagementFeePercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31" id="Fact001550" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">1</ix:nonFraction></span>% management fee per year, and an incentive fee of <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--IncentiveFeePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231_zQHLuF24Vw41" title="Incentive fee percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:IncentiveFeePercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31" id="Fact001552" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>%, not subject to
                                            a hurdle rate. The management fees will adjust the cost of Neostellar Capital&#8217;s investment
                                            in the fund.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in"><span id="xdx_F08_zYNXlgOTzxjc" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(6)</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1A_zmtftkvSZnee" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001553" xml:lang="en-US">CW
                                            Opportunity 2 LP is a special purpose vehicle (&#8220;SPV&#8221;) for which the Class A Interest
                                            is solely invested in the Class A Common Shares of CoreWeave, Inc. Neostellar Capital is
                                            invested in the Class A Common Shares of CoreWeave, Inc. through its investment in the Class
                                            A Interest of CW Opportunity 2 LP. On March 28, 2025, CoreWeave, Inc. completed an IPO and
                                            the Series C Preferred Shares converted to Class A Common Shares. Prior to the IPO, Neostellar
                                            Capital was invested in the Series C Preferred Shares of CoreWeave, Inc. through its investment
                                            in the Class A Interest of CW Opportunity 2 LP. Additionally, prior to the IPO, the Series
                                            C Preferred Shares of CoreWeave, Inc. accrued a <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--PreferredStockDividendRatePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesCPreferredStockMember_z8KDMbkDbkPk" title="Preferred dividend, percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockDividendRatePercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_us-gaap_SeriesCPreferredStockMember" id="Fact001555" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum dividend, paid quarterly in
                                            cash or in-kind. CW Opportunity 2 LP does not charge a management fee but does charge an
                                            incentive fee of <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--IncentiveFeePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesCPreferredStockMember_zJochZaftLYg" title="Incentive fee percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:IncentiveFeePercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_us-gaap_SeriesCPreferredStockMember" id="Fact001557" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">20</ix:nonFraction></span>%, subject to an annual <span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--HurdleRatePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesCPreferredStockMember_zcF1NnauGkL4" title="Hurdle rate percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:HurdleRatePercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_us-gaap_SeriesCPreferredStockMember" id="Fact001559" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">15</ix:nonFraction></span>% IRR hurdle rate. During the year ended December
                                            31, 2025, Neostellar Capital received distributions as part of its investment in CW Opportunity
                                            2 LP. The distributions represented approximately <span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--InitialInvestmentPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--CWOpportunity2LPMember_zC811012sS" title="Initial investment percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:InitialInvestmentPercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_CWOpportunity2LPMember" id="Fact001561" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">31.9</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the initial investment in CW Opportunity
                                            2 LP. As of December 31, 2025, Neostellar Capital retains approximately <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--RetainsInvestmentPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--CWOpportunity2LPMember_zUUIJ2C3pSNa" title="Retains investment percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:RetainsInvestmentPercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_CWOpportunity2LPMember" id="Fact001563" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">68.1</ix:nonFraction></span>% of its investment
                                            in CW Opportunity 2 LP.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

