                                            Ltd. through an SPV. Neostellar Capital is invested in the Series B Preferred Shares of VAST
                                            Data, Ltd. through its investment in the Membership Interest of IH10, LLC. IH10, LLC does
                                            not charge a management fee or an incentive fee; however, Neostellar Capital has prepaid
                                            operating expenses.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr></table>

