    <td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F19_zXh58jc6xNKj" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001569" xml:lang="en-US">Neostellar Capital&#8217;s investments in True Global Ventures 4 Plus Pte Ltd are held through Neostellar Capital&#8217;s wholly owned subsidiary, GSVC SVDS Holdings, Inc. True Global Ventures 4 Plus Pte Ltd charges a <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--ManagementFeePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--LimitedPartnerFundInvestmentMember_zbhLsm3Xz9O2" title="Management fee percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:ManagementFeePercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_LimitedPartnerFundInvestmentMember" id="Fact001571" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">1.8</ix:nonFraction></span>% management fee and a <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--IncentiveFeePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--LimitedPartnerFundInvestmentMember_zPprfH1fb9jb" title="Incentive fee percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:IncentiveFeePercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_LimitedPartnerFundInvestmentMember" id="Fact001573" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">22.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% incentive fee, subject to an annual <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--HurdleRatePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--LimitedPartnerFundInvestmentMember_zcPqwAeOeuy8" title="Hurdle rate percentage" class="xdx_phnt_U3RhdGVtZW50IC0gQ29uZGVuc2VkIENvbnNvbGlkYXRlZCBTY2hlZHVsZSBvZiBJbnZlc3RtZW50cyAoVW5hdWRpdGVkKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="NSLR:HurdleRatePercentage" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_LimitedPartnerFundInvestmentMember" id="Fact001575" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">5</ix:nonFraction></span>% IRR hurdle rate. The management fees may adjust the cost of Neostellar Capital&#8217;s investment in the fund.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>

