                                            Stock also includes the Company&#8217;s investment in the Class A Interest of ARK Type One
                                            Deep Ventures Fund LLC which is invested in the Series A-2 Preferred Shares of OpenAI Global,
                                            LLC, the Company&#8217;s investment in the Membership Interest of IH10, LLC which is invested
                                            in the Series B Preferred Shares of VAST Data, Ltd. through an SPV, and the Company&#8217;s
                                            investment in the Class A Interest and Class B Interest of Magnetar Opportunity 2025-4 LP
                                            which is invested in the Series B Preferred Shares of TensorWave, Inc.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr></table>

