table below shows a reconciliation from the aggregate principal amount of 6.50% Convertible Notes due 2029 to the balance shown on the
Condensed Consolidated Statements of Assets and Liabilities.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span><span id="xdx_8BF_zteZURKDOCD3" style="display: none">SCHEDULE
OF RECONCILIATION
FROM  AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 6.50% CONVERTIBLE NOTES DUE 2029</span></p>

