<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact003041" name="NSLR:ScheduleOfInvestmentsTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_891_ecustom--ScheduleOfInvestmentsTableTextBlock_zgHW0IXPTHB8" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">From
July 1, 2026 through August 5, 2026, the Company exited the following investment.</span></p>

