                                            economic downturn could impair our portfolio companies&#8217; ability to continue to operate,
                                            which could lead to the loss of some or all of our investments in such portfolio companies;</span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


